          "Text": "Veles Colony's offerings aren't quite as diverse as those you'll find on, say, Coruscant. Just the same, you can find most of what you need here. Apartments, banks, a general store, a manufacturing lab, this starport, and much more can be found throughout the city. Be sure to talk to the locals too. I'm sure you'll find work if you're into that sort of thing [She laughs for a moment.]",
